Z||000001||Steve Normington||08-20-2001||03:09 PM||||Before we can make suggestions, please answer the following questions:<P>How much money do you have budgeted?<BR>What is your mechanical ability?<BR>Do you want turn-key or DIY?<BR>What do you want this car for (commuting, cruising, street racing, sleeper, show car, autocross, drag racing)?<BR>||||reg||1
